<div style='width: 80%; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; text-align: justify'>
<div class='humble-topic-header'>Use Defined Virtual Functions</div>

<p>
    A powerful and innovative feature of The Humble Framework is its use of Virtual Functions.
    A Virtual Function is defined using YaML to identify a resource, either remote or local, that
    can be invoked through something that looks like a local function call.  
</p>

